      "decision_index": 68,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Thermo-Alchemist is currently untapped and its untap trigger from casting Goblin Wizardry is on the stack. By tapping Thermo-Alchemist now to deal 1 damage before the untap trigger resolves, Valley would get a free extra ping (the untap trigger would then untap it again for future use). By passing, the untap trigger resolves on an already-untapped creature and does nothing, wasting 1 free damage.",
      "action_taken": "Passed priority, letting the untap trigger resolve while Thermo-Alchemist was already untapped.",
      "better_line": "Activate Thermo-Alchemist to deal 1 damage to the opponent, then let the untap trigger resolve to untap it again, netting 1 free damage.",
      "type": "blunder",
