      "decision_index": 71,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Declined to activate Thermo-Alchemist to deal 1 free damage to the opponent (14 life). Thermo-Alchemist's tap ability costs no mana and deals 1 damage to each opponent. With Goblin Wizardry on the stack (an instant), the Thermo-Alchemist untap trigger likely already resolved or will resolve, meaning activating now would be pure upside - deal 1 damage now, and it untaps when the spell resolves or when another instant/sorcery is cast later.",
      "action_taken": "Passed priority without activating Thermo-Alchemist, missing 1 free damage.",
      "better_line": "Activate Thermo-Alchemist to deal 1 damage to the opponent before passing priority, since it's a free activation that costs no mana.",
      "type": "blunder",
