    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "With Goblin Wizardry (an instant/sorcery) on the stack, Thermo-Alchemist could have been tapped now to deal 1 damage, then it would untap when Goblin Wizardry resolves (triggering its 'whenever you cast an instant or sorcery, untap' ability), allowing a second activation later. By passing, DSV3 Valley missed 1 extra point of damage.",
