    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Cast Selhoff Occultist (2/3 with irrelevant mill ability) instead of Sailor of Means (1/4 + Treasure token) when at 11 life facing an aggressive board with multiple attackers. The 1/4 body blocks ground threats much more effectively, and the Treasure token provides crucial mana flexibility for future turns (enabling double-spell turns or holding up interaction).",
