    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Failed to activate Thermo-Alchemist to deal 1 damage to the opponent before the stack resolves. The opponent is at 10 life, and this free point of damage (bringing them to 7 instead of 8 after Hungry Flames) has no downside since Thermo-Alchemist has defender, can't attack, and there's no way to untap it again this turn (only Kinetic Augur, a creature, is in hand).",
