      "description": "DSV3 Valley declined to activate Thermo-Alchemist to deal 1 damage to the opponent for free. With Hungry Flames already cast (triggering the untap), Thermo-Alchemist was available to tap for 1 damage. With only Kinetic Augur (a creature) in hand and no more instants/sorceries to cast, there was no reason to hold the activation. This wastes 1 point of free damage against an opponent at 10 life.",
