      "description": "At 1 life, Grok4F Libby timed out and took no action. The opponent's Thermo-Alchemist will untap next turn and tap to deal 1 damage, killing Libby. Sweep Away was available to bounce the Thermo-Alchemist, which was the only way to survive. Additionally, creatures like Sailor of Means or Reckless Scholar could have been deployed as blockers against the opponent's attackers.",
